      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠯᠢᠮ</unicode>
      <uighur>delim</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дэлэм</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DELIM</transcript>
      <definition>n. The space necessary to stretch a bow, distance between the two ends of a stretched bow; a linear measure (from the tips of the fingers of an outstretched arm to the shoulder of the other arm), half an alda (fathom).</definition>
      <page>250</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠯᠢᠮ ᠢᠶᠡᠨ ᠭᠦᠢᠴᠡᠲᠡᠯ᠎ᠡ ᠲᠠᠲᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ijen gyicetel-e tataxu</transcript>
          <definition> To draw ( a bow) to its full capacity.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
